   <text>
      <front/>
      <body>
         <div>
            <opener>
               <pb ed="TBOO" n="VIII.393"/>
               <persName key="herwart_von_hohenburg_hans_georg_1553">IOANNES GEORGIUS
                    HERWARTUS AB HOHENBURG</persName> AD <persName key="brahe_tycho_1546">TYCHONEM BRAHE</persName>.</opener>
            <p rend="noIndent">
               <pb ed="A" n="242v"/>LITERAS tuas, Vir Nobilissime atque Mathematicorum omnium
                    facile Princeps, quas quidem die 14 huius mensis <placeName ref="Praha">Pragæ</placeName> ad me dedisti, ex <placeName ref="Ingolstadt">Ingolstadio</placeName> ad me transmissas, hac ipsa horâ probe accepi. D.
                        <persName key="varsevicius_christophorus_1543">CHRISTOPHORUS VARSEVICIUS</persName>, uti
                    optassem, ad me non venit. M. <persName key="kepler_johannes_1571">IOAN. KEPLERUM</persName>
                    male valere doleo, et æque contristor, conditione commodâ eum iam carere. Si
                    apud <persName key="rudolf_2_1552">Cæsaream Maiestatem</persName>, quod abominor, ei
                    non sit <app>
                  <lem wit="#TBOO">permanendum</lem>
                  <rdg wit="#A">permandendum</rdg>
               </app>, ipse quoque dispiciam, anne forte alibi res suas instituere queat.</p>
            <p rend="indent">Tabulas <persName key="bianchini_giovanni_1410">BLANCHINI</persName>, <persName key="prugner_nicolaus_1557">PRUGNERI</persName> et <persName key="peurbach_georg_von_1423">BEURBACHIJ</persName>, quas petis, curabo, si modo extent, ut habeas.
                        <persName key="angelus_johannes_1453">IOANNIS ANGELI</persName> Astrolabium et
                    Planum cum <persName key="angelus_jacobus_1360">IACOBO ANGELO</persName> de Cometis
                    ob defectum tabellariorum mitto hisce iunctum, teque quam fœlicissime florere ex
                    animo opto.</p>
            <closer>
               <dateline>Datæ <placeName ref="München">Monachij</placeName> die 27 Nov. A.
                    1600.</dateline>
            </closer>
         </div>
      </body>
